    {
      "id": "c95e3dd9ec923045",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# Change\n`pedido.md` → `arquiteto` → `plano.md`",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 320,
      "height": 140,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "a3218734457b9a9b",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Touches API, schema, config, dependency or 5+ files?",
      "x": 400,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 320,
      "height": 140,
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "d018268506e28685",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Stop\nThe user approves the plan",
      "x": 800,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 320,
      "height": 140,
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "83f1535f99ab0bf4",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## testador (reproduction)\na failing test; bugs only",
      "x": 1200,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 320,
      "height": 140,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "e77989ed21758e78",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## desenvolvedor\ncode in the service layer; ruff and area tests; `mudancas-NN.md`",
      "x": 1600,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 320,
      "height": 140,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "0f826a89cf68c399",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## testador (coverage)\nfull suite and coverage; `testes-NN.md`",
      "x": 2000,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 320,
      "height": 140,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "48cd7517d21176f9",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## revisor-de-codigo + auditor-de-seguranca\nin parallel: `revisao-NN.md`, `seguranca-NN.md`",
      "x": 2400,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 320,
      "height": 140,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "a585257a5b4d06da",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## REVISAR?\nblocker, or 3+ important (max 2 rounds)",
      "x": 2800,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 320,
      "height": 140,
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "7ffc4d510260a854",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Report\nfiles, CI output, verdicts. No commit.",
      "x": 3200,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 320,
      "height": 140,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "a1213419a0c503fc",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# Audit\n`auditor-de-saude` → `saude.md`\n`auditor-de-seguranca` → `seguranca-01.md`",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 400,
      "width": 320,
      "height": 140,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "ecd2ec43c588ae01",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Ranked list\nSTOP: the user picks the items",
      "x": 400,
      "y": 400,
      "width": 320,
      "height": 140,
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "447b7147e84be512",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Approved item\nbecomes a change run, with the item as the request",
      "x": 800,
      "y": 400,
      "width": 320,
      "height": 140,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "5d8d1cb9136777c8",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Integration research and harness\n`pesquisador-de-integracoes` (installs nothing) · `mantenedor-do-harness`",
      "x": 1200,
      "y": 400,
      "width": 320,
      "height": 140,
      "color": "5"
    }
  ],
